      "title": "JSNation 2019 Aftermovie",
      "description": "Amsterdam JSNation 2019 was a 2-day event focusing exclusively on JavaScript development. At our conference, inspiring talks met fresh ideas and good people with summer Amsterdam in the background. We recognize JavaScript development as an art of engineering that is why conference took place in a former church Rembrand attended, located in the center of the city right next to the best places Amsterdam has to offer.",
